# Reporting Rules

- Aging buckets are exactly: 0-29, 30-59, 60-89, 90+.
- Health badge: Excellent=green, Good=blue, Fair=amber, Poor=orange,
  Critical=red.
- Risk chips: Low=green, Medium=amber, High=orange, Critical=red.
- Multi-currency: always convert via forex_rate (seeded). Show a badge
  when conversion was applied. Never sum raw amounts across currencies.
- Charts use fl_chart. Aging = horizontal stacked bar. Monthly billing =
  grouped bar by month × practiceArea. Invoices by bucket = bar + table
  toggle.
- Every reporting screen must also render OK/Fail + latency in the
  Reporting Health Check view.